          },
          {
            "text": "误操作后解决方案",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": true
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "修改内核参数net.ipv4.ip_forward=0",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "网络不通",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "修改内核参数为 net.ipv4.ip_forward=1",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "修改内核参数net.ipv4.tcp_tw_recycle=1",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "导致nat异常",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "修改内核参数 net.ipv4.tcp_tw_recycle=0",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "修改内核参数net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse=1",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "导致网络异常",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "修改内核参数 net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse=0",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "节点安全组配置未放通容器CIDR的53端口udp",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "集群内DNS无法正常工作",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "参照新建集群的安全组进行修复，放通安全组。\n\n详情请参见集群安全组规则配置。",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "删除default-network的network-attachment-definitions的CRD资源",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "容器网络不通，集群删除失败等",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "误删除该资源需要使用正确的配置重新创建default-network资源。",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "启动iptables防火墙",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "CCE默认不开启iptables防火墙，开启后可能造成网络不通\n\n 说明：\n\n不建议开启iptables防火墙。如必须启动iptables防火墙，请在测试环境中确认/etc/sysconfig/iptables和/etc/sysconfig/ip6tables中配置的规则是否会对网络连通性造成影响。",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "关闭iptables防火墙，并检查/etc/sysconfig/iptables和/etc/sysconfig/ip6tables中配置的规则。",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "容器隧道网络集群节点升级内核或升级openvswitch",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "容器网络不通\n\n 说明：\n\n容器隧道网络集群数据面组件采用的是华为优化后的openvswitch组件，不支持自行升级为操作系统自带的openvswitch。",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          },
          {
            "text": "恢复方式请参见如何解决yum update升级操作系统导致容器网络不可用问题？",
            "rowspan": 1,
            "colspan": 1,
            "header": false
          }
        ]
      ]
